    "text": "Let <math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> where <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>c</mi></math> are positive integers. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>,&nbsp;then the greatest value of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is (where <math><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> denotes the trace of matrix <math><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;i.e. the sum of principal diagonal elements of matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>)"
